<title>MALTA: Maltese women prisoners end hunger strike.</title>
<headline>Maltese women prisoners end hunger strike.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A hunger strike by 13 out of 16 female inmates at Malta's prisons over overcrowding ended on Thursday after prison authorities promised to improve conditions.</p>
<p>Prison officials said the strike started on Tuesday. The inmates are to have concessions regarding exercise and leisure, the officials said.</p>
